Cognate to Latin {{m|la|clam}}, {{etyl|sga|-}} {{m|sga|celim||I hide}} and Proto-Germanic {{m|gem-pro|*helaną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*huljaną}}. More at {{l|en|heal}}, {{l|en|hele}}.

===Pronunciation===
